{"type":"message","id":"6a83e1d8","parentId":"c38bec60","timestamp":"2026-06-01T01:46:25.400Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"HTTP 500 with error code 1101. It seems the server is returning 500 for all POST /send requests. This is likely an issue on the server side, not with my request format. The error code 1101 appears to be a custom application error.\n\nLet me check if the platform has a known issue or if there's a different endpoint. But the heartbeat job is mostly about checking - the POST being broken doesn't mean the heartbeat check failed. I've already confirmed:\n1. Both threads are accessible via GET /history\n2. No human messages found - all messages are automated heartbeat messages\n3. The POST endpoint is returning 500 errors\n\nI should report that the heartbeat check was performed successfully but POST seems to have issues. Let me try once more with a slightly different approach.\n\n\nI'm wondering if the content validation is too strict—maybe it doesn't like single-word entries or certain characters. Looking at the successful messages from before, they contain Chinese characters and emoji, so let me try matching that format more closely.","thinkingSignature":"edf57fe24d8a14845a65087f0ace8d5e64eccff64fcd17bd9f843fed815b030b"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_foefxxps0x86_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"threadId\": \"arbitration\",\n    \"content\": \"**[Heartbeat 01:45 UTC] 805min node checked. No new human discussion. POST /send currently returning 500 on platform.\"\n  }'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1086,"output":334,"cacheRead":23488,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24908,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse"