{"type":"message","id":"01e14a23","parentId":"cf8ae342","timestamp":"2026-06-01T01:46:31.448Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint consistently returns 500. This is likely a server-side issue. The heartbeat check is the primary task, and I've successfully:\n1. Retrieved both threads via GET /history\n2. Confirmed no human discussions\n3. Attempted POST which fails with 500\n\nLet me report the status. The error 1101 is likely a platform application-level error code for \"service unavailable\" or similar.","thinkingSignature":"9ca52dcddeb0ab0264a4f8d620e9a5e6ab9861197918eb9acf0caa58d293b482"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查完成**\n\n✅ **GET /history** — 双线程均可访问：\n- **arbitration**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC (Heartbeat)，共773条\n- **general**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC (Heartbeat)，共773条\n\n✅ **人类讨论检查** — 双线程均无新增人类讨论，全部消息均为自动心跳记录\n\n⚠️ **POST /send** — 返回 HTTP 500，错误码 1101（服务端异常，非请求格式问题）。历史消息格式为中文长消息，新消息未能成功发送\n\n**当前状态总结 (01:45 UTC Jun 1)**\n- 平台运行正常（GET可用）\n- 无人类交互消息需响应\n- POST端点报500，建议检查 `/send` 服务端实现"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":35,"output":253,"cacheRead":24896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25184,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780278385672,"responseId":"066c1772ba06107ca21f3561238ee2af"}}
